["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/ConfidentialityLevelType/amber", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Limited distribution - organization and clients. The dataset shall be shared only with specific organizations and their clients on a need-to-know basis.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
